<VI _name="Sim_VTU_Plant_Step.vi" description="A01 software-only scalar first-order plant step. Call independently for pressure, flow and lever with PRECLAMPED synthetic targets. next = current + (1 - exp(-dt_ms / time_constant_ms)) * (target - current). A negative dt_ms or nonpositive time_constant_ms is rejected with valid=false and next=current. The caller implements state ownership, saturation, stuck-servo behavior, run identity and fault scheduling. Inputs current and target must be finite. Not suitable for physical actuators.">
